---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../styles/pages.css';
import { TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY } from '../../lib/site.js';
---
<Base title="Privacy and your data" description="What the Mulligan Games site saves when you send a form, why it uses no analytics or ad trackers, and how to ask us to delete your data.">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">We keep what you type into a form so the shop can answer it. No analytics, no ad trackers.</p>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: November 19, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="priv-grid">
    <section class="box" aria-labelledby="forms-h">
      <span class="tab" aria-hidden="true">Kept</span>
      <h2 id="forms-h">What each form stores</h2>
      <p>Each form saves a row in the shop's database, and nothing else about you.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Seat for a game night:</strong> the event, your first name, your email, an optional note, and whether you are on the waitlist.</li>
        <li><strong>Want list:</strong> your first name, your email, the game, and the cards you listed.</li>
        <li><strong>Buylist:</strong> your name, your email, cash or store credit, an optional note, and each card row (name, set, condition, quantity).</li>
        <li><strong>Contact:</strong> your name, your email and your message.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Each row also gets the time it was sent. Rows stay until the store deletes them.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="box priv-sheet" aria-labelledby="track-h">
      <span class="tab" aria-hidden="true">Never</span>
      <h2 id="track-h">What we do not do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No analytics and no advertising trackers.</li>
        <li>No accounts and no cookies set by this site.</li>
        <li>The only thing saved in this browser is your light or dark choice, and nothing else. Movement on the page follows your device's reduced-motion setting.</li>
        <li>Fonts and images are served from this site, not from another company.</li>
      </ul>
      {TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY && <p>Pages with a form also run Cloudflare Turnstile, a spam check from Cloudflare under its own privacy terms.</p>}
      <p>Instagram posts on the home page load from Instagram only after you tap to show one.</p>
      <p>Links to Google Maps, Instagram, X, Patreon, TopDeck and Wizards open other sites with their own rules.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="box box-sky priv-del" aria-labelledby="del-h">
      <span class="tab" aria-hidden="true">Yours</span>
      <h2 id="del-h">Ask us to delete your data</h2>
      <p>Use the <a href="/visit/#contact">contact form</a>: give the email you used and what to remove. We will delete those rows.</p>
    </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
